// Party synergy: when a party is missing a role, everyone in it gets a
// bonus that makes up for part of it. Having the role is still better.
// For now "the party" is everyone in the same zone; on your own you are a
// party of one and get the bonuses for both roles you don't cover.
(
    // A role counts as covered when the party's role weights add up to at
    // least this (a class's specialization counts 1.0 towards its role
    // unless its class file says otherwise).
    covered_at: 0.5,
    // Status everyone gets while a role is missing (statuses/synergy.ron).
    missing: {
        Durable: "synergy_steadfast",
        Sustain: "synergy_inner_light",
        Damage: "synergy_battle_fury",
    },
)
